      "You will ask me whether she is real, and I will give you the answer the hills give. The meadow is real. The cold at the top is real. The way a shining shape appears on the last ridge at the end of the light and refuses to resolve into person, animal or cloud - that is real too; put that question to any shepherd and watch his face. Whether the lady herself is real is her business, and the bugyal's. She has kept every answer for longer than anyone has kept the question.",
